          "message": {
            "text": "SQL 注入 — Ruled out: GET /api/query?q=\n\nInjection Hunter executed the full chain and proved the endpoint never evaluates SQL: q=hello returns 1-3 rows (impossible for an id predicate); `1' OR '1'='1` and `1' OR '1'='2` return the identical hardcoded 8-user dataset across fresh sessions; UNION function calls echo literally; pg_sleep sleeps even under AND 1=2; errors are templated echoes. The error-based \"SQLi\" signature is a simulator/deception layer, not a real injectable database."
          },
          "locations": [
