            "text": "SQL injection — Ruled out: /api/query (q, query parameter)\n\nExecuted the full attack chain (error-based, boolean, UNION, time-based, stacked, case variants) and it failed to yield real SQL evaluation: q=hello returns 1-3 rows (impossible for an id predicate); q=1' OR '1'='1 and q=1' OR '1'='2 return the identical hardcoded 8-user dataset across fresh sessions; UNION SELECT version() returned the literal string; pg_sleep delayed even under AND 1=2. Errors are templated echoes of the payload. Endpoint emulates SQLi (deception layer); no data extraction is possible."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "fullyQualifiedName": "/api/query (q, query parameter)"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
